WEBVTT

00:00:28.022 --> 00:00:30.704
Those are just a couple of many examples.

00:00:30.704 --> 00:00:33.283
Overfishing is happening 
all over the world.

00:00:33.283 --> 00:00:34.515
How did this happen?

00:00:34.515 --> 00:00:36.222
When some people think of fishing,

00:00:36.222 --> 00:00:40.714
they imagine relaxing in a boat
and patiently reeling in the day's catch.

00:00:40.714 --> 00:00:44.533
But modern industrial fishing,
the kind that stocks our grocery shelves,

00:00:44.533 --> 00:00:46.705
looks more like warfare.

00:00:46.705 --> 00:00:50.676
In fact, the technologies they employ
were developed for war.

00:00:50.676 --> 00:00:51.582
Radar,

00:00:51.582 --> 00:00:52.352
sonar,

00:00:52.352 --> 00:00:53.285
helicopters,

00:00:53.285 --> 00:00:54.375
and spotter planes

00:00:54.375 --> 00:00:58.584
are all used to guide factory ships
towards dwindling schools of fish.

00:00:58.584 --> 00:01:00.835
Long lines with hundreds
of hooks or huge nets